      "justification": "The paper's Algorithm 1/Section 5 text states SWD 'neutralizes the 1/k attenuation' via reweighting sampling probabilities, while Theorem 3's 1/k term arises from the buffer composition recursion (Proposition 1), so the formal link between reweighting and eliminating the structural coefficient is indeed not rigorously derived in the paper, matching the reviewer's critique.",
